# --scene Assets/Scenes/Tests/HierarchyTest.lvl
# The "what's working" status (ED-14): background work shows in the title bar with its progress,
# notices show as toasts with the action that fixes them. A stand-in task and notice stand for a
# cook and a failed build (the real ones report the same way: WorkStatus).
wait 20
work-begin Cooking | 0.4
notify The scripts don't build (2 errors) | View.ErrorList
wait 10
assert-work Cooking | 1
screenshot .tmp/EditorFlows/StatusFlows.png
wait 5
work-end
wait 2
assert-work Cooking | 0
